WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.666
Do you think your generation failed on October 7?

00:06.966 --> 00:11.633
We failed because we did a lot of things,

00:12.333 --> 00:14.166
and October 7 happened.

00:16.933 --> 00:20.266
We didn't kill anyone, we didn't rape anyone,

00:21.966 --> 00:23.133
but...

00:25.600 --> 00:32.433
we didn't do enough things to avoid it.

00:33.300 --> 00:37.833
We talked a lot against the wars,

00:38.033 --> 00:40.466
and it was not right.

00:40.466 --> 00:43.833
Maybe, the October 7th,

00:43.833 --> 00:50.600
maybe if we had done much more things,

00:52.066 --> 00:53.500
before...

00:53.500 --> 00:57.066
Maybe, maybe,

00:57.100 --> 01:02.066
we would be sitting here in another situation,

01:02.700 --> 01:03.666
another conversation.

01:05.166 --> 01:06.433
But we failed.

01:06.433 --> 01:09.833
We took the the wrong decisions.

01:11.333 --> 01:12.833
It's my generation,

01:12.833 --> 01:14.233
it's my government.

01:15.066 --> 01:17.300
I don't care about them.

01:17.900 --> 01:19.733
They are just...

01:25.066 --> 01:27.866
actors in this game.

01:31.766 --> 01:33.433
If we would...

01:34.300 --> 01:35.800
if we were...

01:36.100 --> 01:41.733
If we had done it in another way,

01:42.533 --> 01:49.033
Maybe all this would never have come onto the world.

01:49.733 --> 01:52.366
All those damage, all those deaths

01:52.366 --> 01:54.233
on these pictures.

01:56.900 --> 02:01.400
Yuval had his 29ths birthday,

02:01.466 --> 02:04.066
just a day before October 7th

02:05.366 --> 02:09.366
Yuval was the favorite of my grandsons,

02:10.766 --> 02:13.266
they called him in Hebrew:

02:13.266 --> 02:14.900
"Dod Yuvi", uncle Yuvi

02:14.900 --> 02:17.366
He's not from our family, but they called him.

02:17.366 --> 02:19.966
They liked him. Maybe he would still be here,

02:21.100 --> 02:23.800
him and his generation would (still) be here,

02:24.066 --> 02:29.133
if we had taking other decisions.

02:29.966 --> 02:31.500
The hard ones.

02:31.700 --> 02:33.466
We chose

02:33.633 --> 02:36.333
the easy one: "Just to do peace".

02:36.333 --> 02:38.233
Now there will be no peace.
